# Maintainer: local build (not for AUR)
# Based on AUR mpv-full-build-git by Inochi Amaoto <libraryindexsky@gmail.com>
# Adds CAVS/AVS+/AVS2(10-bit)/AVS3/AV3A/DRA decoding via a patched FFmpeg 9.0.2,
# following the decoder stack of https://github.com/nilaoda/mpv-iina-avs.
# The FFmpeg patches are vendored next to this PKGBUILD and applied in filename order.

